00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:55.690
- And when did you start your
slime entrepreneurship career?

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:58.930
- I started slime in 2016.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.800
- Got it, and was it first just hobby

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.810
